{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10011","headline":"题李将军山亭 · 郭良","name":"题李将军山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤辖将军位，龙门司隶家。\n衣冠爲隐逸，山水作繁华。\n径出重林草，池摇两岸花。\n谁知贵公第，亭院有烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}